        v "But it simply is not enough."
        v "Your existence could be more useful in service of something much greater."
        r "What the {i}hell{/i} does that mean?!"
        v "I told you the truth. I was looking for my relatives, and I was fairly certain only you were left alive. But I needed to make sure."
        v "The process can be... unreliable if there are more options."
        v "I am afflicted. I need to get rid of this body."
        v "I quite enjoy my current form. I'd hate to spend the rest of my days crawling on the ground like a common worm."
        v "Your father wasn't willing to give back the life I had bestowed him, so..."
        "My legs won't stop shaking. It's hard to think."
        v "If you'd be so kind as to cooperate."
        v "I'll put your years to good use. Mine are effectively endless, after all."
        menu:
