        v "The mother of Aarne and Lennart."
        v "Before anything else, I'd like to know what happened to her."
        v "... If you'd be so kind."
        r "..."
        "I don't owe him anything."
        "I don't think I can really trust him… even if he's not a liar."
        "... But I don't know what else to do."
